# Semua berkas teks memakai akhir baris LF, juga di clone Windows. Git for Windows memakai core.autocrlf=true
# secara bawaan, dan skrip shell yang di-mount ke container Linux (certs.sh, backup.sh, deploy/db/*.sh)
# gagal dijalankan bila berakhiran CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.apk binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.dump binary
